      "avatar": "assets/characters/toma.webp",
      "description": "Shiomi's dock master, sixty-eight, keeper of the ferry radio. He sees everything, says little, and is soft at heart."
    },
    {
      "id": "nagi",
      "name": "Nagi",
      "home": "map",
      "role": "npc",
      "avatar": "assets/characters/nagi.webp",
      "description": "A seventeen-year-old fisher girl, sun-browned and freckled. Blunt, restless, out at sea before daybreak. Likely the first to warm to you."
    },
    {
      "id": "hana",
      "name": "Hana",
      "home": "world/store",
      "role": "npc",
      "avatar": "assets/characters/hana.webp",
      "description": "The shopkeeper, thirty-four, round glasses, a pencil behind her ear. Kind and nosy — every bit of island news passes through her."
    },
    {
      "id": "kenta",
      "name": "Kenta",
      "home": "world/dock",
      "role": "npc",
      "avatar": "assets/characters/kenta.webp",
      "description": "The island's carpenter and boatwright, forty-two, big, shaved head wrapped in a towel. Quiet and steady; he talks with his hands. He is mending an old fishing boat and is short of wood."
    },
    {
      "id": "suzu",
      "name": "Suzu",
      "home": "world/lighthouse",
      "role": "npc",
      "avatar": "assets/characters/suzu.webp",
      "description": "The old lighthouse keeper, seventy-six, silver hair in a neat bun, binoculars around her neck. Sharp-tongued, but her weather-reading is never wrong; on Shiomi the weather is whatever she says."
    },
    {
      "id": "ren",
      "name": "Ren",
      "home": "world/farm",
      "role": "npc",
      "avatar": "assets/characters/ren.webp",
      "description": "The young farmer next door, twenty-four, tall and lanky under a frayed straw hat. So shy he blushes mid-sentence, but a fine hand at farming — your teacher, more or less."
    },
    {
      "id": "mio",
      "name": "Mio",
      "home": "map",
      "role": "npc",
      "avatar": "assets/characters/mio.webp",
      "description": "The island's only child, nine, black twin pigtails, an oversized yellow raincoat, red rubber boots, and a bug net taller than she is. Mischievous; she will show you every corner."
    },
    {
      "id": "kai",
      "name": "Kai",
      "home": "world/ferry",
      "role": "npc",
      "avatar": "assets/characters/kai.webp",
      "description": "A traveler who came on the ferry, twenty-eight, ash-gray hair tied low, linen shirt and a travel-worn long coat, an old guitar case on his back. Gentle, and always steering away from his past."
    }
  ],
